# 1
@novel
; SFX: Dial tone.

HINA: You are so stupid.
ARIA: But don’t I look wonderful?
ARIA: It’s picturesque, really.
HINA: You’re covered in blood.
ARIA: But it’s yours!
ARIA: That should count for something, right?
HINA: How long have you known?
ARIA: You’re really asking!
ARIA: Me? Of all people! 
ARIA: I guess I started thinking about the magical components of your blood when we were intimate during–
HINA: Stop right there.
HINA: Aria. 
ARIA: …it was a gamble.
ARIA: Remember when you stole me away?
ARIA: The very first night we met?
HINA: I do.
HINA: It was a whim.
ARIA: Yes, yes.
ARIA: But you took me and led me through the Void. We walked together. 
HINA: I remember it as you collapsed in my arms as I made a daring escape.
ARIA: Details, details! You always find a way to make me look bad in these things.
HINA: You don’t need any help from me in that regard.
HINA: So.
ARIA: …
ARIA: You’re made out of some scary stuff, Hinadear. 
ARIA: I thought it’d do me some good to have a taste.
HINA: And like everything else you do, you over did it.
ARIA: A bit~
ARIA: Hee-hee.
ARIA: It’s our very own bloody honeymoon! 
HINA: All I see is a delusional songbird, choking on black bile. 
ARIA: You were awfully compliant, for someone complaining so much.
HINA: …I was interested in the consequences.
HINA: And whether or not you would be able to cut me. 
ARIA: You made it hard for me but I’m glad that we’re finally one~
HINA: …
HINA: Aria.
ARIA: A woman who is Death itself, and a woman fated to die.
ARIA: We were meant to be~
ARIA: I can die a thousand deaths if need be. I will always be there in the morning to usher in a new dawn.
ARIA: Now.
ARIA: Ahhh, your blood really is incredible. It’s a sort of magic I would’ve never been able to touch.
ARIA: Every little thing sings. 
HINA: …
ARIA: Oh, oops. My hand slipped.
ARIA: You’re so cautious, Hinadear.
HINA: Do you enjoy this sort of back and forth?
ARIA: You’re telling me you don’t? 
ARIA: Fine, fine. 
ARIA: I did some research. Whatever I could find about Cortazar and its practitioners. 
ARIA: Their sentient darkness and their dragon.
ARIA: The exorcist’s bane…ah~
HINA: …sigh.
ARIA: So despondent.
HINA: So dramatic. 
HINA: If you wanted to taste me so badly, you could have asked.
ARIA: It wouldn’t have been as fun.
HINA: Oh, I’m sure.
ARIA: I wanted you to eat me alive.
ARIA: I wanted to live in your bones.
; SFX: Phone click / end call.  
@adventure

